OL,4,CAndy Taylor: Duran Duran             W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GAndy Taylor, who has died aged 65,   W5
OL,7,Gwas the wild boy of Duran Duran.     W5
OL,8,                                      W5
OL,9,GIn the early 1980s, the pop legends  W5
OL,10,Gsold over 100 million records and    W5
OL,11,Gdominated the charts in both Britain W5
OL,12,Gand the United States.               W5
OL,13,                                      W5
OL,14,GBut success came at a cost. For      W5
OL,15,GTaylor, global superstardom became a W5
OL,16,Gcocaine and alcohol fuelled          W5
OL,17,Gnightmare that left him burnt out    W5
OL,18,Gand battling clinical depression.    W5
